Package: pmhcDenoiseR
Title: pMHC denoising and pMHC-TCR assigment. 
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Grigorii", "Nos", , "nosgrigoriy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8066-7424"))
Description: pmhcDenoiseR is a data denoising workflow for single-cell pMHC datasets. The workflow also assigns the 
             pMHC specificities to individual clonotypes. pmhcDenoiseR works with coupled single-cell pMHC counts with TCR clonotypes.
